  "prefLabel": "Plc 702.03 Biological indicator test",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 702.03 “Biological indicator test” means a test of the efficacy of sterilization processes and equipment, which uses a commercially-prepared device with a known population of highly-resistant bacterial spores to test the efficacy of sterilization.\n\nSource. #13495, eff 12-22-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 700)",
